---
offerAudience: business
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: Business Fixed Prices
heading: Fixed prices for your business
standfirst: Set prices for the jobs small businesses actually need doing, each with the time it should take. Prices exclude VAT.
description: Fixed-price business IT in Penarth, Barry and Cardiff — Microsoft 365, Google Workspace, servers, networks, backups and Cyber Essentials.
---

<section class="section">
  <div class="container">

    {% include "partials/price-switch.njk" %}

    <p class="lead">
      Every job below has one price and the time it is expected to take, so you
      can see what you are buying rather than watching a meter. If something
      turns out to be bigger than it looked, we stop and tell you before going
      further — you decide what happens next.
    </p>

    <div class="bands">
      {% for group in businessprices.groups %}
      <div class="band">
        <div class="band-head">
          <p class="band-cat">{{ group.name }}</p>
        </div>
        <div class="band-body">
          {% if group.blurb %}<p class="band-blurb">{{ group.blurb }}</p>{% endif %}
          <ul class="band-list">
            {% for item in group.items %}
            {# The catalogue owns slugs and bookability; the price list only
               displays. Join on the label so the two can never disagree
               silently — a missing join renders no button, not a wrong one. #}
            {% set svc = bookmap[item.label] %}
            <li>
              {# "Quoted" is a word, not an amount — a £ in front of it would read as nonsense. #}
              <span class="item-price">{% if item.quoted %}{{ item.price }}{% else %}£{{ item.price }}{% endif %}</span>
              <span class="item-meta">{{ item.time }}</span>
              <span class="item-label">{{ item.label }}{% if item.addon %} <span class="addon">({{ item.addon }})</span>{% endif %}</span>
              {% if svc and svc.bookable and not svc.existing %}
              <a class="item-book" href="/book/?service={{ svc.slug }}">Book</a>
              {% elif item.quoted %}
              <a class="item-book ghost" href="/quote/">Get a quote</a>
              {% endif %}
            </li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="cta-panel">
      <h2>What is and isn't included</h2>
      <ul class="ticks wide">
        <li><strong>Booking takes a £5 fee</strong>, deducted from the final invoice — the rest is invoiced when the job is done. Need more than one service in a visit? <a href="/quote/">Ask for a custom quote</a> rather than booking twice.</li>
        <li><strong>All prices exclude VAT</strong>, which is how most businesses prefer to see them. VAT is added on the invoice.</li>
        <li>Hardware, parts and software licences are extra, and always agreed with you before anything is bought.</li>
        <li>Travel within our service area is included in the price, and the £{{ site.bookingFee }} booking fee comes off your bill.</li>
        <li>Migrations are quoted rather than fixed. Moving a server or a mailbox is where the surprises live, and a fixed price would only mean one of us losing.</li>
        <li>Work not on this list is charged at £{{ site.businessHourlyRate }} an hour {{ site.vatExLabel }}, or quoted up front — <a href="/quote/">tell us about the job</a> and we will come back with a price.</li>
        <li>If you would rather have ongoing cover than pay per job, our <a href="/support-plans/">support plans</a> include a reduced hourly rate.</li>
      </ul>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
